&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Thatch&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For most people, health insurance is something that happens to them: a plan chosen by someone else, with little room to fit their life. Thatch is changing that. We help companies give every employee a real healthcare budget instead of a one-size-fits-all plan, so people can choose the coverage and care that works for them, and employers get predictable costs they can control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s a simple idea, but making it real means solving hard problems across healthcare, payments, and technology, and we’re just getting started. We look for people who like solving complex problems, use good judgment, and are comfortable working through ambiguity. People here care deeply about our customers, take real responsibility for what gets built, and are driven by doing work that matters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mt-4&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a&amp;nbsp;consultative, strategic Account Executive to join our Mid-Market sales team at Thatch, owning the &lt;strong&gt;East Coast Region&lt;/strong&gt;. Alongside our Broker partners, you will work with HR, finance, and executive stakeholders at companies with 100+ employees to solve complex healthcare challenges. This is an ideal role for someone who can run an exceptional sales process, influence high-level decisions, and help us build a category-defining business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mt-4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If multiple regional roles might be a fit for you, please apply to any one, and we’ll review and adjust internally if needed.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-10&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ml-4 list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead high-stakes consultative sales processes with companies navigating complex benefits needs across the East Coast region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to executive-level buyers in the East Coast, uncovering deep needs and aligning them to Thatch’s solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross functionally with product teams to refine positioning for this segment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and share insights on the competitive landscape in the East Coast region, influencing go-to-market strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive forecasting accuracy and pipeline health for the East Coast territory through disciplined sales operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with existing and new broker partners across the East Coast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel within the East Coast region to build relationships and support broker partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-10&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;Background we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ml-4 list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in group benefits mid-market consulting, specifically tier 1 or tier 2 brokerage firm background, healthcare carrier field representation, payroll sales, or HR tech / SaaS sales is a requirement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of group health insurance underwriting, including plan design, contribution strategies, and key cost/risk drivers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at leading discovery, building business cases, and influencing multiple stakeholders across finance, HR, and executive teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-10&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;Experience we’d be particularly excited about&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ml-4 mt-4 list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inquisitive and thoughtful — you know how to ask the right questions and listen deeply&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about creating a healthcare system that people will love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable managing long and potentially very quick sales cycles and adapting to shifting priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who consistently embodies the Thatch brand and effectively represents our broker partners and clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role covers the East region, and we are prioritizing candidates based in Georgia, Pennsylvania, North Carolina and Florida to support travel and territory coverage, but candidates in other locations will also be considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-10&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;What to expect&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mt-4&quot;&gt;We interview rigorously based on integrity, talent, and drive; the trust we display in our teammates from day 1 is a reflection of the confidence we have in this process. We aim to evaluate the things you’ll be doing every day as best we can, and we move quickly. Here&#39;s what to expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ml-8 mt-4 list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 minute video meeting to talk through your background and interest in Thatch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;45 minute video meeting with the hiring manager to get a high level understanding of your experience and deep into your sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 minute video meeting to meet 3 members of the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 minute video meeting to go over a case study assignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 minute video meeting with our founders to discuss your approach to culture and our operating principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note: The posted compensation range reflects On-Target Earnings (OTE), not base salary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Estimated Compensation Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$300,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Thatch&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For most people, health insurance is something that happens to them: a plan chosen by someone else, with little room to fit their life. Thatch is changing that. We help companies give every employee a real healthcare budget instead of a one-size-fits-all plan, so people can choose the coverage and care that works for them, and employers get predictable costs they can control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s a simple idea, but making it real means solving hard problems across healthcare, payments, and technology, and we’re just getting started. We look for people who like solving complex problems, use good judgment, and are comfortable working through ambiguity. People here care deeply about our customers, take real responsibility for what gets built, and are driven by doing work that matters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mt-4&quot;&gt;We’re hiring a driven and adaptable Account Executive to join our SMB segment at Thatch. In this role, you’ll engage with growing businesses navigating healthcare benefits for the first time — blending both transactional hustle and strategic guidance. You’ll work cross-functionally, communicate clearly, and help us build the systems that power repeatable success in this space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-10&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ml-4 list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a hybrid sales motion, balancing fast-moving transactional deals with larger, compliance-involved opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage key stakeholders and educate them on Thatch’s healthcare solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailor pitches to a mix of technical and non-technical buyers across various industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product, growth, and customer success to iterate and improve the SMB sales playbook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track pipeline metrics rigorously and proactively report on trends and forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel occasionally for team on-sites or key customer meetings, typically under 20 percent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-10&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;Background we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ml-4 list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-3 years of proven sales experience in group insurance, payroll services, or ICHRA solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator who can adjust style based on audience — from HR leaders to CFOs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in ambiguity and navigating compliance-heavy conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-10&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;Experience we’d be particularly excited about&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ml-4 mt-4 list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in a startup environment and excited about building process from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with benefits, HR tech, or compliance-related sales is a bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combination of payroll and group insurance experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Spanish is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-10&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;What to expect&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mt-4&quot;&gt;We interview rigorously based on integrity, talent, and drive; the trust we display in our teammates from day 1 is a reflection of the confidence we have in this process. We aim to evaluate the things you’ll be doing every day as best we can, and we move quickly. Here&#39;s what to expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ml-8 mt-4 list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 minute video meeting to talk through your background and interest in Thatch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 minute video meeting with the hiring manager to dive deeper into your experience and the role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 minute video meeting to meet 2-3 members of the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 minute video meeting to go over a case study assignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 minute video meeting with our Sales Leadership and one of our Co-founders to discuss your approach to culture and our operating principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note: The posted compensation range reflects On-Target Earnings (OTE), not base salary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Estimated Compensation Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$140,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$160,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Thatch&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For most people, health insurance is something that happens to them: a plan chosen by someone else, with little room to fit their life. Thatch is changing that. We help companies give every employee a real healthcare budget instead of a one-size-fits-all plan, so people can choose the coverage and care that works for them, and employers get predictable costs they can control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s a simple idea, but making it real means solving hard problems across healthcare, payments, and technology, and we’re just getting started. We look for people who like solving complex problems, use good judgment, and are comfortable working through ambiguity. People here care deeply about our customers, take real responsibility for what gets built, and are driven by doing work that matters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For most people, health insurance happens to them: a plan chosen by someone else, with little room to fit their life. Thatch is changing that. We help companies give employees a healthcare budget instead of a one-size-fits-all plan, so people can choose the coverage and care that works for them while employers get predictable costs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It&#39;s a simple idea, but making it real means solving hard problems across healthcare, payments, and technology. We&#39;re just getting started. We look for people who use good judgment, take ownership, and care deeply about building something that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design is central to what makes Thatch stand out. We&#39;re building a brand that sets a new standard for healthcare. We&#39;re a small, collaborative team with high standards for craft, bold creative thinking, and a shared ambition to make something complex feel remarkably simple.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Brand Designer&lt;/strong&gt; to help shape Thatch&#39;s next chapter. We&#39;ve built a product people love, and now we&#39;re ready to bring that same ambition to our visual identity. You&#39;ll develop creative concepts and bring them to life across web, campaigns, events, print, and more, helping define how people see and experience Thatch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-10&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ml-4 list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and evolve Thatch&#39;s visual identity, building a distinctive, cohesive brand across every touchpoint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute creative concepts across our website, campaigns, digital content, events, print, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own design projects end to end, from early exploration and creative direction through production and launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing, Product, and Design to translate business goals and complex ideas into compelling creative work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present and advocate for your ideas, incorporating feedback while maintaining a high bar for craft and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with external creative partners when needed, bringing fresh ideas and approaches to how we tell our story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-10&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ml-4 list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of experience in brand, visual, or marketing design, ideally at a startup or high-growth company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong portfolio demonstrating exceptional craft across typography, layout, color, and visual storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating a brand identity into cohesive, high-quality work across digital and physical touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Figma and Adobe Creative Suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to move quickly, iterate thoughtfully, and deliver polished work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and the ability to explain design decisions and collaborate across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity, a sense of ownership, and the judgment to know when to challenge the brief.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-10&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;Experience we’d be particularly excited about&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ml-4 mt-4 list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motion design, animation, or video experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build and ship web experiences using HTML/CSS, Framer, or similar tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI tools to explore ideas and improve creative workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience helping a growing company evolve its brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-10&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;What to expect&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to keep our interview process thoughtful, rigorous, and efficient. Most candidates complete it within three weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 30-minute conversation with a recruiter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 30-minute conversation with the hiring manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio review focused on your creative process, visual craft, and brand thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Functional interviews focused on creative collaboration, communication, and working style.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A final conversation with a member of our executive team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Estimated Compensation Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Thatch&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For most people, health insurance is something that happens to them: a plan chosen by someone else, with little room to fit their life. Thatch is changing that. We help companies give every employee a real healthcare budget instead of a one-size-fits-all plan, so people can choose the coverage and care that works for them, and employers get predictable costs they can control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s a simple idea, but making it real means solving hard problems across healthcare, payments, and technology, and we’re just getting started. We look for people who like solving complex problems, use good judgment, and are comfortable working through ambiguity. People here care deeply about our customers, take real responsibility for what gets built, and are driven by doing work that matters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mt-4&quot;&gt;Thatch is rethinking how health insurance is provided and used in the US, and compliance is core to what we do. Our compliance obligations span insurance regulation, financial services, employee benefits, and IRS requirements–often at the same time. You&#39;ll be part of the team that keeps that program running: reviewing marketing and advertising against state insurance rules and federal advertising requirements, executing our monitoring and testing procedures and documenting the results, and working second-line review of customer accounts and transaction monitoring escalations. You&#39;ll do this alongside experienced compliance and legal colleagues and, regardless of your level, will learn so much as you help build this function out. We&#39;re looking for someone with a few years of compliance or regulatory experience who is precise, organized, and genuinely interested in&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;why&lt;/em&gt; a rule exists, not just whether a box got checked.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-10&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ml-4 list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review marketing copy and customer-facing materials against policy, rules, and requirements. Maintain the advertising files and approval records those rules require&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support monitoring and testing procedures: pull samples, gather evidence, document results, and track identified issues through remediation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work second-line review of customer onboarding (KYB/C) and transaction monitoring escalations, complete enhanced due diligence (EDD) requests, document dispositions, and escalate cases that warrant review by senior team members or financial partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain compliance recordkeeping, policy and procedure documentation, and the evidence needed to support audits, examinations, and partner diligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with teams around Thatch including Marketing, Product, Operations, and Financial Partnerships to answer routine compliance questions and route the harder ones to the right person&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support employee compliance training delivery and completion tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-10&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;Background we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ml-4 list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree with 3+ years of experience in compliance, regulatory operations, risk, audit, or a closely related function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to at least one regulated environment — insurance, banking or payments, securities, healthcare, or benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong writing skills and real precision with detail; you can document what you did clearly enough that someone else can rely on it a year later&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized with a demonstrated ability to manage recurring workflows and competing deadlines without dropping threads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about overlapping regulatory regimes and the judgment to know when to ask rather than assume&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good sense of humor… you work in compliance, so it&#39;s ok if it is a little dark&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-10&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;Experience we’d be particularly excited about&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ml-4 mt-4 list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in health insurance, financial services, or another regulated industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on KYB/C, AML, or transaction monitoring alert review experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience executing control testing or supporting an audit or regulatory examination&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with modern compliance tooling and an interest in using AI to make recurring review work faster and better documented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a startup or high-growth environment where the procedure didn&#39;t exist yet or decision frameworks are evolving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-10&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;What to expect&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mt-4&quot;&gt;We interview rigorously based on integrity, talent, and drive; the trust we display in our teammates from day 1 is a reflection of the confidence we have in this process. We aim to evaluate the things you’ll be doing every day as best we can, and we move quickly. Here&#39;s what to expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ml-8 mt-4 list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 minute video meeting to talk through your background and interest in Thatch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 minute video meeting with the hiring manager to dive deeper into your experience and the role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 minute video meeting to meet 2-3 members of the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 minute video meeting with department leadership to discuss alignment to the role and career goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 minute video meeting with our founders to discuss your approach to culture and our operating principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Estimated Compensation Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$65,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$77,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Thatch&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For most people, health insurance is something that happens to them: a plan chosen by someone else, with little room to fit their life. Thatch is changing that. We help companies give every employee a real healthcare budget instead of a one-size-fits-all plan, so people can choose the coverage and care that works for them, and employers get predictable costs they can control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s a simple idea, but making it real means solving hard problems across healthcare, payments, and technology, and we’re just getting started. We look for people who like solving complex problems, use good judgment, and are comfortable working through ambiguity. People here care deeply about our customers, take real responsibility for what gets built, and are driven by doing work that matters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thatch is building our customer advocacy function from the ground up — which means there&#39;s no playbook to inherit and no ceiling on what it becomes. We&#39;re building it as its own function from zero, at the exact moment you’ll make a sizable impact on the company&#39;s growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own the program end to end: a formal sales reference process that connects the right customer to the right prospect at the right time, and a customer advocacy motion that turns our strongest customers into public voices for Thatch — case studies, speaking opportunities, and a community of HR leaders who chose to do things differently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a builder&#39;s role. The program, the mechanics to make advocacy scalable, and the community are yours to define. You’ll work closely with Sales, Customer Success, and Marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-10&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ml-4 list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and run a sales reference program that connects the right customers with the right prospects, supports pipeline and win rates, and avoids overusing your strongest advocates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a strong bench of customer advocates and create an experience that makes participation valuable for them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create opportunities for customers to advocate through conferences, webinars, podcasts, events, roundtables, and peer conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the systems and processes to manage advocates, requests, availability, and outcomes, using AI and automation to operate efficiently at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the program’s impact across reference usage, content, pipeline influence, and win rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-10&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ml-4 list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in customer marketing, advocacy, community, or a related function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building a customer reference or advocacy program from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of turning customer relationships into measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong partnership with Sales and Customer Success, including the judgment to push back when an ask isn’t right for the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating as a senior, hands-on IC in a fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-10&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-4 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:text-2xl&quot;&gt;Experience that stands out&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ml-4 mt-4 list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fintech, HR tech, benefits, healthcare, or another trust-driven B2B category.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships with industry analysts, media, conference organizers, or other relevant external communities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-10&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What to expect&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to keep the process thoughtful, rigorous, and efficient. Most candidates complete it within three weeks. You can expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;541&quot; data-end=&quot;580&quot;&gt;Initial conversation with a recruiter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;583&quot; data-end=&quot;609&quot;&gt;Hiring manager interview.&lt;/li&gt;
