&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influencing product roadmaps and prioritization through data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building experimentation practices, including guardrail metrics, sample-size guidance, or analysis frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
