&lt;li&gt;Hire, coach, and grow a team of support specialists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring seasoned judgment to setting operational strategy and metrics, and hold the business to clear accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hand-in-hand with operations and cross-functional leaders to scale the business without eroding the customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and analyze how the team is performing, and report on it on a regular cadence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry our values forward – acting as a champion for Thatch&#39;s customer-centric philosophy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen the organization through management work: recruiting, training, drafting team policies, defining process, and other structural improvements&lt;/li&gt;
