&lt;li&gt;30 minute video meeting with our founder to discuss culture, values, and how we operate as a company.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to move efficiently while giving you space to share your thinking, ask questions, and get a real sense of what it’s like to work here.&lt;/p&gt;
